{"id":"657569","name":"辣子鸡","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/657569/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1块"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"5-6颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两只鸡腿。","img":"images/657569/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡腿肉拆下来，切块。","img":"images/657569/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱姜片，蚝油，酱油，盐，胡椒粉，抓拌腌制鸡块。","img":"images/657569/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"腌好的鸡肉，放一点淀粉。","img":"images/657569/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓上浆。","img":"images/657569/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"六成油热以后，下锅炸。","img":"images/657569/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"低温炸熟，高温复炸，炸脆。","img":"images/657569/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再起锅。","img":"images/657569/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"留一点底油，小火煸炒葱姜片。","img":"images/657569/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入辣椒。","img":"images/657569/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入炸好的鸡块。","img":"images/657569/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前，撒一把芝麻。","img":"images/657569/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}